{"asset_key":"ep8/herohub_story_18411160","episode":"ep8","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"18411160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1841116001:0":{"text":"まさか自分がグレイヴボーンの土地で、しかも記憶を失った状態で暮らすなんて夢にも思わなかったよ。","source_cn":"我以前从没想过，自己有一天竟然会来到亡灵的领地上生活，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8C6A08270C88E3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1841116002:1":{"text":"しかもその間、セリスにあんな無遠慮なことを散々言ってしまったなんて……","source_cn":"最重要的是，我竟然在失忆期间和爱丝说了那么多没轻没重的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6695444FFD53652","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1841116002":{"text":"しかもその間、セリスにあんな無遠慮なことを散々言ってしまったなんて……","source_cn":"最重要的是，我竟然在失忆期间和爱丝说了那么多没轻没重的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6695444FFD53652","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1841116003:0":{"text":"ごほん……それ以上は言わないでくれ。穴があったら入りたい気分だ……","source_cn":"啊……快别说了，简直太尴尬了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD439110B5A1F9B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1841116004:0":{"text":"昔はセリスの手本になろうと、頼もしい兄としてずっと気をつけていたのに……完全に本性がバレてしまったよ。","source_cn":"从前为了给爱丝树立榜样，我一直努力在她面前维持一位哥哥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC7529528223A691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1841116005:0":{"text":"その取り繕いが原因で、セリスは「レナード」が自分の従兄だと気づけなかったのだからな。","source_cn":"就是因为你以前伪装得太好，爱丝才没有认出“里纳”就是你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D39C65FFFBDABB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1841116006:1":{"text":"それがなければ、私たちはもっと早く再会できていたかもな。","source_cn":"如果她早点知道，或许我们还能更早些团聚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8444D2E5666EABBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1841116007:1":{"text":"いや……あの時セリスは赤燭花に寄生され、生死の境を彷徨ってたんだ。そんな状態で俺がバートンだと気づけば、それこそショックで病状が悪化していたかも……","source_cn":"她当时被赤烛蕊寄生，生命垂危，要是再在那种情况下知道我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A56FE7241B3932","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1841116008:1":{"text":"だから、むしろ幸運だと言うべきだよ。","source_cn":"所以我很庆幸，她没认出我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4557F5B4705F29FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1841116009:1":{"text":"セリスは、お前が思っているよりずっと強い。","source_cn":"爱丝远比你想象得更坚强。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED07AB9D826E2B79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1841116010:1":{"text":"お前がいなかった数年間で、かなり成長したからな。","source_cn":"你不在的这几年里，她成长了很多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4957AC1B60F915A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1841116011:1":{"text":"ああ、見ていれば分かるよ。","source_cn":"看得出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60BF6E1964212CB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1841116012:1":{"text":"ここまで来られたのも……セイン、すべて君のおかげだ。","source_cn":"这一切都要感谢你，瑟恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x336DC16C0AC6A716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1841116013:1":{"text":"……礼には及ばん。","source_cn":"……不客气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAAC72E716520F41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1841116014:1":{"text":"それはそうと、君にもう一つ頼みがあるんだ！","source_cn":"话说回来，如果你能办到另一件事，我会更加感激你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50A1C83D9391E1B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1841116015:1":{"text":"――セリスの中での俺のイメージを、挽回するのを手伝ってくれ！","source_cn":"——帮我挽回我在爱丝心里的形象！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64"